cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or build on its results, please cite it as below."
title: "ReJev: Jev-inspired decision-model experiments on MiniCPM5-2B"
abstract: >-
  An independent, reproducible reproduction of the Jev-style decision-model
  training pipeline on MiniCPM5-2B (stage 1: single-letter Choice classification).
  Includes the rendering/splitting half of the data pipeline, LoRA training and
  constrained-decoding evaluation code, the sealed holdout discipline, and the
  experiment records (three paths are excluded in full: the exp005 record — the
  four-way comparison involving third-party weights; plans 007/008 — the
  weight-release plans; and the weight-release toolchain under src/publish/
  (it ships via the HF/ModelScope channel and depends on files not part of
  this export; its unit-test fixtures contain literal
  malformed-credential patterns). The upstream data-build
  pipeline is not included either). Not affiliated with TypeSafe or with the
  tev1 project.
# 作者字段说明：alias 供 GitHub 引用面板显示；family-names 供 Zenodo 提取作者名
# （Zenodo 的作者解析器读 name / family-names / given-names，不读 alias——只写 alias 会得到空名）。
# 如需真实姓名与 ORCID，在此补充后即可被学术索引正确归属。
authors:
